  m_text: 'RULES OF THE GAME

    A living cell with fewer than two living neighbours
    dies.

    A living cell with two or three living neighbours lives on.

    A
    living cell with more than three living neighbours dies.

    A dead cell with
    exactly three living neighbours comes alive.'
